  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your shield is a near-divine bulwark that protects you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Greater Shield Specialization<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As long as you have a shield equipped with which you have Shield Specialization, you can expend a use of mythic power to negate the effect of any one attack roll against you, as long as it is not a critical hit. You can expend a use of mythic power to negate the effect of any one critical hit against you, causing it to be treated as a normal successful attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc152\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
